  "notes": "{繋|つな}げる means to connect, link, or tie things together.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {繋|つな}がる (intransitive) - to be connected\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- インターネットに{繋|つな}げる: to connect to the internet\n- WiFiに{繋|つな}げる: to connect to WiFi\n- {手|て}を{繋|つな}げる: to join hands\n- {点|てん}と{点|てん}を{繋|つな}げる: to connect the dots\n- {次|つぎ}の{世代|せだい}に{繋|つな}げる: to pass on to the next generation\n\nFIGURATIVE USES:\n- {命|いのち}を{繋|つな}げる: to sustain life\n- {関係|かんけい}を{繋|つな}げる: to maintain a relationship\n- {話|はなし}を{繋|つな}げる: to continue/extend a conversation\n\nNOTE:\nThe kanji {繋|つな} can also be written as {繫|つな} (variant form).",
